The adversarial recovery case exposed a real Darwin-specific edge: even ordinary `rename` rejects a read-only directory. I’ve changed quarantine to reserve a unique destination, temporarily grant owner control only through a verified no-follow handle (then restore the original mode after the atomic move), and added `0700`, `0550`, and `0000` candidate cases. Those targeted cases now pass.
